{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.MotivicSubstrateTrivial","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.MotivicSubstrateTrivial","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.MotivicSubstrate"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.trivial_motivic_substrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.trivial_motivic_substrate","kind":"instance","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/MotivicSubstrateTrivial.lean#L31-L48","doc":"Trivial witness: every field is the obvious choice over `ℤ`.\n\n`lefschetz := 1` is conceptually wrong (the Lefschetz motive is\n`[𝔸¹]`, not `[Spec ℤ]`), but algebraically valid: `1` is a unit\nin `ℤ`, satisfying `lefschetz_invertible`.  Real instances must\npick the actual class of `𝔸¹` in `K₀(Var_k)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.inst_comm_ring_trivial_target","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.inst_comm_ring_trivial_target","kind":"instance","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/MotivicSubstrateTrivial.lean#L28-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.trivialTarget","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.trivialTarget","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/MotivicSubstrateTrivial.lean#L25-L26","doc":"Constant-`ℤ` realisation target at every place. ","signatureChunk":0}]}